            <div id="document"><div>&nbsp;</div>
<h2>e is Irrational&nbsp;</h2>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;theorem&quot;" data-shell_title="Theorem:">
<p><strong>Theorem: </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;e is irrational&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__text"> is irrational</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;proof&quot;" data-shell_title="Proof:">
<p><strong>Proof</strong>: We will prove this theorem by contradiction.</p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p>Therefore, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;assume e is rational&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">assume </span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__text"> is rational</span></span></span></span></span>. That is, &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;e=m/n ,1 leq n for some m,n in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.94em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">m</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit">m</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>We can multiply each side by <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;n!&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span></span></span>, yielding&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*e=n!*(m/n)\n=(n-1)!*m by algebra&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.92em;"><span style="top: -3.91em;"><span style="height: 2.14em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.92em;"><span style="top: -3.91em;"><span style="height: 2.14em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.686em; height: 1.6165600000000002em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size2">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.94em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">m</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size2">)</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -2.09em;"><span style="height: 1.2em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.08333em; height: 0.72777em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">m</span><span class="ML__text"> by algebra</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Using the definition of <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;e&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">e</span></span></span></span></span>, and splitting the series at <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span></span>, we obtain</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*e=n!*(sum(1/k!,k,0,infinity))\n=n!*(sum(1/k!,k,0,n)+sum(1/k!,k,n+1,infinity))\n=n!*(sum(1/k!,k,0,n)) + n!*(sum(1/k!,k,n+1,infinity)) by algebra&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 5.19em;"><span style="top: -7.18em;"><span style="height: 3.36em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 5.19em;"><span style="top: -7.18em;"><span style="height: 3.36em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 2.9535100000000005em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.83em;"><span style="height: 3.42em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -0.42em;"><span style="height: 3.12em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 2.9535100000000005em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__text"> by algebra</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p>Rearranging this equation we obtain</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*sum(1/k!,k,n+1,infinity)=(n!*sum(1/k!,k,0,n) + n!*sum(1/k!,k,n+1,infinity))-n!*sum(1/k!,k,0,n) by algebra\n=n!*e-n!*sum(1/k!,k,0,n)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 3.44em;"><span style="top: -5.43em;"><span style="height: 3.42em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 3.44em;"><span style="top: -5.43em;"><span style="height: 3.42em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__text"> by algebra</span></span></span><span style="top: -2.12em;"><span style="height: 2.96em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">We will prove this expression is an integer. We have that <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;n!\\cdot e= (n-1)! \\cdot m&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1)!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">m</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;(n-1)!*m in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.08333em; height: 0.72777em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">m</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> by the closure of <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\mathbb{Z}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> under subtraction, factorial, and multiplication, so</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*e in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by substitution&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by substitution</span></span></span></span></span>. Additionally,&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\begin{align} n! \\cdot \\sum_{k=0}^{n} \\frac{1}{k!}&amp;=\\frac{n!}{0!}+\\frac{n!}{1!}+\\frac{n!}{2!}+\\cdot\\cdot\\cdot+\\frac{n!}{n-1}!+\\frac{n!}{n!}\\\\\n&amp;=(n\\cdot\\cdot\\cdot 4\\cdot 3\\cdot 2\\cdot 1)+(n\\cdot\\cdot\\cdot 4\\cdot 3\\cdot 2)+(n\\cdot\\cdot\\cdot 4\\cdot 3)+ \\cdot\\cdot\\cdot+ (n)+(1)\\\\\n\\end{align}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 2.48em;"><span style="top: -4.47em;"><span style="height: 3.26em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 2.48em;"><span style="top: -4.47em;"><span style="height: 3.26em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.2em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">0!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.2em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.2em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">2!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.2em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.2em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -2.03em;"><span style="height: 1.2em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">4</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">3</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">2</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1)</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">4</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">3</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">2)</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">4</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">3)</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">)</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">(1)</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;is a sum of integers, so&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*sum k=0 to n of 1/k! in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> as well (Lemma 4). Since the difference of two integers is an integer, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*e-n!*sum k=0 to n of 1/k! in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> and therefore&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k! in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by substitution&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by substitution</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;In order to reach a contradiction we now show that this expression cannot be an integer.&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;Notice for any <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;1 \\leq n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span></span> and any <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;1 \\leq k&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\begin{align}\n\\frac{n!}{(n+k)!}&amp;=\\frac{1}{n+k} \\cdot \\cdot \\cdot \\frac{1}{n+2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{n+1}\\\\\n&amp;&lt; \\frac{1}{n+1} \\cdot \\cdot \\cdot \\frac{1}{n+1} \\cdot \\frac{1}{n+1} \\\\\n&amp;=\\left(\\frac{1}{n+1}\\right)^k \\\\\n\\end{align}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 3.89em;"><span style="top: -6.35em;"><span style="height: 2.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.2em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 1em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">)!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 3.89em;"><span style="top: -6.35em;"><span style="height: 2.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.78em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">2</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.97em;"><span style="height: 2.22em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -1.23em;"><span style="height: 2.62em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.7693300000000001em; height: 1.91377em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size3">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size3">)</span></span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.67em;"><span style="top: -4.17em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p>This inequality extends to the series (Lemma 3), and which can then be combined with the<br>geometric series formula (Lemma 5) to determine that</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*sum(1/k!,k,n+1,infinity) &lt; \n(1/(n+1)) * sum((1/(n+1))^k,k,0,infinity)= (1/(n+1))*(1/(1-1/(n+1)))\n=1/n by algebra&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 4.48em;"><span style="top: -6.56em;"><span style="height: 3.33em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 4.48em;"><span style="top: -6.56em;"><span style="height: 3.33em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.7693300000000001em; height: 1.91377em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size3">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size3">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.7693300000000001em; height: 1.91377em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size3">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size3">)</span></span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.67em;"><span style="top: -4.17em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.15em;"><span style="height: 3.31em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.7693300000000001em; height: 1.91377em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size3">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size3">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.1274389999999999em; height: 2.2718789999999998em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.27em;"><span style="height: 1.24em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.84em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.65em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.38em;"><span style="height: 0.46em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -0.45em;"><span style="height: 1.84em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__text"> by algebra</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p>Again by closure we have <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt; n!*sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (Lemma <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\alpha&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="lcGreek ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.01em;">&alpha;</span></span></span></span></span>). In addition, since&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;1/n leq 1&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span></span> (Lemma 1) we see that</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*sum(1/k!,k,n+1,infinity) &lt; 1/n\nleq 1&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 2.51em;"><span style="top: -4.5em;"><span style="height: 3.32em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 2.51em;"><span style="top: -4.5em;"><span style="height: 3.32em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -2em;"><span style="height: 1.2em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">However, no integer is strictly between <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;0&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;1&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span></span>. Therefore,&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k! notin ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&notin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">However, we have already shown that <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;n! \\cdot \\sum_{k=n+1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{k!} \\in \\mathbb{Z}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>. Thus we have proven a contradiction, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;contradiction&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&rarr;&larr;</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<p>Therefore, we can conclude that <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;e is not rational&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__text"> is not rational</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;Therefore, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;e is irrational&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__text"> is irrational</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
